##grflangid 0x01

DEBUG :Debug

STR_GRF_NAME :Romanian stations
STR_GRF_DESCRIPTION :{BLUE}Roman{YELLOW}ian st{RED}ations{}{BLACK}A NewGRF with nice Romania-inspired passenger railway stations.{}{SILVER}Features{}{BLACK}- Automatic line end buffers{}- Visible passengers, depending on the station load, that can "move"{}- Single-sided platforms, that can be built in one go with alternating sides (this feature is enabled by default){}- Station roofs of configurable colours (by default red, can be any of the company colours or the owning company's colour)

STR_PARAM_METAL_ROOF_RECOLOR :Station roof colour
STR_PARAM_METAL_ROOF_RECOLOR_DESC :Colour of the metallic station roofs. By default, the colour is set to red.

STR_PARAM_PLATFORM_ALTERNATE :Alternate platform sides of one-platform stations
STR_PARAM_PLATFORM_ALTERNATE_DESC :If this setting is on, building one-platform stations will make the platform side (top or bottom) of the tiles to alternate through the tracks built in one go.

STR_PARAM_COLOUR_COMPANY :Company colour
STR_PARAM_COLOUR_DARK_BLUE :Dark blue
STR_PARAM_COLOUR_PALE_GREEN :Pale green
STR_PARAM_COLOUR_PINK :Pink
STR_PARAM_COLOUR_YELLOW :Yellow
